# Leave BOTH of these EMPTY for local / LAN development.
#
# In dev, the frontend reaches the backend through Vite's proxy on the SAME
# origin (port 5173), so other devices on the network only need to open that
# one port. Setting VITE_API_URL to http://localhost:8080 would force every
# client to call ITS OWN localhost and break LAN access.
#
# Set these ONLY for a production build where the backend lives at a fixed URL:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://api.your-domain.com
#   VITE_WS_URL=wss://api.your-domain.com/ws
#
# VITE_API_URL=
# VITE_WS_URL=
